BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:Meetup: Sonoma-Marin Brat Pack
UID:event_315203584@meetup.com
SEQUENCE:1
DTSTAMP:20260611T043739Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260614T163000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260614T180000
SUMMARY:Pop Fiction ( free music )
DESCRIPTION:Sonoma-Marin Brat Pack\n**Event is cross posted with other mee
 tup groups*\nThe Novato Art\, Wine & Music Festival Art is happening all w
 eekend and there will be several performances beforehand so feel free to c
 ome any time. I will be just showing up for Pop fiction which is scheduled
  for 4:30 pm and I will post what I’m wearing and where I’ll be exactl
 y on the day of the event\, will try to get a spot near the stage area if 
 able.\n\nPop Fiction – Northern California’s Premier Party Band\nBased
  in the San Francisco Bay Area\, Pop Fiction has been dazzling audiences s
 ince their first show in 2009. From the minute they hit the stage\, Pop Fi
 ction churns out non-stop dance hits\, sing-alongs\, and favorites from th
 e 70s\, 80s\, 90s\, 2000s and beyond\, guaranteed to keep the dance floor 
 packed and audiences of all ages thrilled all night.\n\nLocation: Grant Av
 enue (between Redwood Blvd and Seventh St) in Historic Old Town Novato. Th
 is is the start of the festival . The stage is a couple blocks down.\n\nPa
 rking can be a hassle but there is a Whole Foods nearby and If taking smar
 t train you can hop of at downtown Novato station . Both locations are in 
 walking distance to the venue .
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/sonoma-marin-brat-pack/events/3152035
 84/
